§ `s 37`

#ASSERT `the standard of care is met` `full disclosure backed by logical peer opinion`
#ASSERT NOT `the standard of care is met` `peer-backed but illogical`
#ASSERT NOT `the standard of care is met` `generic risks only, nothing on this patient's known concern`
#ASSERT `the standard of care is met` `withholding with reasonable justification`
